  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the salt-block vessel over medium heat for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced carrots and cubed potatoes, cooking for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped nuka-pickle, water, salt, and black pepper, stirring well to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Let the stew cool for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Serve the stew in bowls and enjoy."
